flowchart LR
    subgraph controlPlane [控制平面_任务决策与状态管理]
        API[API服务]
        Orchestrator[编排引擎]
        Scheduler[调度器]
        MetaDB[(元数据库)]
        Auth[身份认证]
        Permission[Permission 权限]
        Audit[Audit 审计]
        Crypto[Crypto_KMS 密钥服务]
        AI[AI建议服务]
    end

    subgraph dataPlane [数据平面_实际数据读写]
        SyncWorker[SyncWorker]
        StreamRuntime[StreamRuntime]
        Exec[执行组件]
        Source[(源库)]
        Target[(目标库)]
    end

    API --> Orchestrator --> Scheduler
    Scheduler -->|"下发作业"| SyncWorker
    Exec -->|"位点与进度回写"| Scheduler
    Exec -.->|"短期凭证"| Crypto
    SyncWorker --> StreamRuntime --> Exec
    Exec --> Source
    Exec --> Target
